# Python's compiled scratch files.
#
# These are rewritten every time the code runs, so without this they show up as
# changes constantly and cause merge conflicts between teammates that mean
# nothing. They are also tied to one Python version, so they are useless to
# anybody on a different one.
#
# This rule belongs here rather than in .git/info/exclude because every
# teammate needs it, and there is nothing confidential about a .pyc file.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
